# A fresh build must never ingest host secrets, live data, Git history or
# generated local outputs, even if a Dockerfile COPY is broadened later.
.git
.gitignore
.env*
**/.env*
.fresh-setup
**/.fresh-setup
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.log
**/*.pid
docs
docs-gap
.handoff
infra
